const faqs = [
  { q: 'Has there been any terrorist activity in Uganda?', a: 'Uganda experienced a bomb attack in Kampala in 2021. The country\'s security services have significantly increased vigilance since then. Crowded public places in Kampala (shopping malls, markets) carry a standard elevated risk common to many East African capitals. National parks and safari destinations have not been targeted and the threat level there is considered low.' },
